(120622,'chemistry','What is the IUPAC name for the compound in the given diagram(1256)','Cyclopentylethyne','For pi bond outside a saturated ring, the ring is considered as substituent. Reference: (NCERT Chemistry Class 11; Page No. 344; Paragraph No. 3)','Organic chemistry >> Organic chemistry - some basic principles and techniques >> Nomenclature of organic compounds with functional group',NULL,'3','mcq','Ethynylcyclopentane','Cyclopentylethyne','Cyclopenylacetylene','Ethynylpenatne','NEW',NULL,NULL,'/ncert/pyq/chemistry/mcq/120622q.png'),
