(120625,'chemistry','What is the IUPAC name for the compound in the given diagram(1259)','3,3-dimethylbutan-1-ol','Functional group should get the lowest number. Reference: (NCERT Chemistry Class 11; Page No. 344; Paragraph No. 2)','Organic chemistry >> Organic chemistry - some basic principles and techniques >> Nomenclature of organic compounds with functional group',NULL,'3','mcq','2,2-dimethyl-4-butanol','3,3-dimethylbutan-1-ol','3,3,3-trimethyl-1-propanol','None of these','NEW','11-344','11-266','/ncert/pyq/chemistry/mcq/120625q.png'),
(120626,'chemistry','What is the IUPAC name for the compound in the given diagram(1260)','3-Bromopentane','Functional group should get the lowest number with longest carbon chain possible. Reference: (NCERT Chemistry Class 11; Page No. 344; Paragraph No. 2)','Organic chemistry >> Organic chemistry - some basic principles and techniques >> Nomenclature of organic compounds with functional group',NULL,'3','mcq','Pentylbromine','3-Bromopentane','1-Bromo-1-ethylpropane','None of these','NEW','11-344','11-266','/ncert/pyq/chemistry/mcq/120626q.png'),
