(80422,'chemistry','Which elements of 3d series have nearly same radius?','Ni and Co','Ni and Co are  elements of 3d series having nearly same radius. \nMetallic radii : Co : 125 pm Ni : 125 pm\nIonic radii :     Co²⁺ : 74 pm   Ni²⁺ : 70 pm\n                       Co³⁺ : 61 pm   Ni³⁺ : 60 pm\n(Reference: NCERT Chemistry Class 12; Page 220; Table 8.2)','Inorganic chemistry >> The d- and f-Block Elements >> Variation in Atomic and Ionic Sizes of Transition Metals',NULL,'1','mcq','Ni and Cu','Ni and Co','Fe and Cu','Sc and Zn','NEW','12-220','12-093',NULL),
