(110223,'biology','Select the incorrect statement w.r.t. facilitated diffusion','Uphill transport','Facilitated diffusion is along concentration gradient i.e., downhill.\nReference  :NCERT Class 11th Pg., 176','Plant Physiology >> Transport in plants >> Diffusion',NULL,'2','mcq','Highly selective','Transport saturates','Requires special membrane proteins','Uphill transport','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(110224,'biology','In antiport,','Two molecules are moved in opposite directions across the membrane','If same direction ⇒ Symport. If occurs only in one direction ⇒ Uniport\nReference  :NCERT Class 11th Pg., 177','Plant Physiology >> Transport in plants >> Diffusion',NULL,'2','mcq','Two molecules are moved in opposite directions across the membrane','Two molecules are transported in same direction across the membrane','Only one molecule is transported across the membrane','No transport occurs','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
