(110308,'biology','Proteins in the membrane are responsible for','Facilitated diffusion','Proteins in the membrane are responsible for facilitated diffusion and active transport and hence show common characteristics of being highly selective.\nReference  :NCERT Class 11th Pg., 178','Plant Physiology >> Transport in plants >> Active Transport  and  Comparison of Different Transport Processes',NULL,'2','mcq','Facilitated diffusion','Lipid diffusion','Diffusion','Both a and b','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(110309,'biology','Proteins in the membrane have characteristics like- \n\n1. Liable to saturate. \n\n2. Inhibitors do not affect the transport\n\n3. Under hormonal control','1 and 3','Proteins in the membrane are responsible for facilitated diffusion and active transport and hence show common characteristics of being highly selective; they are liable to saturate, respond to inhibitors and are under hormonal regulation.\nReference  :NCERT Class 11th Pg., 178','Plant Physiology >> Transport in plants >> Active Transport  and  Comparison of Different Transport Processes',NULL,'2','mcq','1 and 2','1 and 2','1 and 3','2 and 3','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
