(360421,'biology','The total amount of energy that plants assimilate by photosynthesis is called','Gross primary productivity','Gross primary productivity (GPP) is the total amount of  CO₂  "fixed" by land plants per unit time through the photosynthetic reduction of CO₂  into organic compounds.','Ecology >> Ecosystem >> Energy Flow',NULL,'2','mcq','Gross primary productivity','Net primary productivity','Biomass','A pyramid of energy.','NEW','12-243','12-207',NULL),
(360422,'biology','The chain or web is formed because of __________ .','Interdependency','Starting from the plants (or producers) food chains or rather webs are formed such that an animal feeds on a plant or on another animal and in turn is food for another. The chain or web is formed because of interdependency.','Ecology >> Ecosystem >> Energy Flow',NULL,'1','mcq','Interdependency','Dissimilarities','independancy','dependency','NEW','12-245','12-209',NULL),
