(360448,'biology','No energy that is trapped into an organism remains in it for ever. Is this statement true or false ?','True','No energy that is trapped into an organism remains in it for ever. The energy trapped by the producer, hence, is either passed on to a consumer or the organism dies.','Ecology >> Ecosystem >> Energy Flow',NULL,'2','mcq','false','True',NULL,NULL,'NEW','12-245','12-209',NULL),
(360449,'biology','What marks the beginning of the detritus food chain/web in an ecosystem?','The death of an organism','The energy trapped by the producer, hence, is either passed on to a consumer or the organism dies. Death of organism is the beginning of the detritus food chain/web.','Ecology >> Ecosystem >> Energy Flow',NULL,'2','mcq','The birth of a new consumer organism','The death of an organism','The capture of solar energy by producers','The introduction of a new predator species','NEW','12-245','12-209',NULL),
