(360612,'biology','The composition and structure constantly change in response to the changing environmental conditions. This change is done. \nA. orderly \n\nB. sequential\n\nC.parallel \n\nD.Perpendicularly','A,B,C','The composition and structure constantly change in response to the changing environmental conditions. This change is orderly and sequential, parallel with the changes in the physical environment.','Ecology >> Ecosystem >> Ecological Succession',NULL,'1','mcq','A,B','B,C','A,B,C','A,B,C,D','OLD','12-250',NULL,NULL),
(360613,'biology','The changes lead finally to a community that is in near equilibrium with the environment and that is called a ______ community.','climax community','The changes lead finally to a community that is in near equilibrium with the environment and that is called a climax community.','Ecology >> Ecosystem >> Ecological Succession',NULL,'1','mcq','seral community','pioneer community','ecosere community','climax community','OLD','12-250',NULL,NULL),
