(360735,'biology','Gaseous exchanges of phosphorus between organism and environment are :','negligible','Gaseous exchanges of phosphorus between organism and environment are negligible','Ecology >> Ecosystem >> Nutrient Cycle and Ecosystem Services',NULL,'2','mcq','constant','more','less','negligible','NEW','12-255',NULL,NULL),
(360736,'biology','Healthy ecosystems are the base for a wide range of which goods and services,which include\n\ni)economic benifits\n\nii)environmental benifits\n\niii)aesthetic benifits\n\niv) recreation','i,ii,iii','Healthy ecosystems are the base for a wide range of economic, environmental and aesthetic goods and services.','Ecology >> Ecosystem >> Nutrient Cycle and Ecosystem Services',NULL,'2','mcq','i,ii,iii','i,ii','iii,iv','i,ii,iii,iv','NEW','12-255',NULL,NULL),
(360737,'biology','Healthy ecosystems are the base for a wide range of goods and services. The products of ecosystem processes are named as __________','ecosystem services','Healthy ecosystems are the base for a wide range of economic, environmental and aesthetic goods and services. The products of ecosystem processes are named as ecosystem services','Ecology >> Ecosystem >> Nutrient Cycle and Ecosystem Services',NULL,'2','mcq','ecosystem services','ecosystem functions','ecosystem givings','ecosystem jobs','NEW','12-255',NULL,NULL),
(360738,'biology','Healthy forest ecosystems includes','both a and b','Healthy forest ecosystems purify air and water, mitigate droughts and floods, cycle nutrients, generate fertile soils, provide wildlife habitat, maintain biodiversity, pollinate crops, provide storage site for carbon and also provide aesthetic, cultural and spiritual values.','Ecology >> Ecosystem >> Nutrient Cycle and Ecosystem Services',NULL,'2','mcq','purify air and water, mitigate droughts and floods','cycle nutrients, generate fertile soils','both a and b','allows succession of plants','NEW','12-255',NULL,NULL),
