(90701,'biology','In a polypeptide or a protein, amino acids are linked by a peptide bond which is formed when:','Carboxyl (-COOH) group of one amino acid reacts with the amino (-NH2) group of the next amino acid with the elimination of a water moiety','In a polypeptide or a protein, amino acids are linked by a peptide bond which is formed when the carboxyl (-COOH) group of one amino acid reacts with the amino (-NH2) group of the next amino acid with the elimination of a water moiet(Reference  :NCERT Biology Class 11; page no:151, paragraph no:1)','Cell Structure And Functions >> Biomolecules >> Nature of Bond Linking Monomers in a Polymer',NULL,'2','mcq','Carboxyl (-COOH) group of one amino acid reacts with the amino (-NH2) group of the next amino acid with the elimination of a water moiety','Carboxyl (-COOH) group of one amino acid reacts with carboxyl (-COOH) group of the next amino acid with the elimination of a water moiety','Amino(-NH2) group of one amino acid reacts with the amino (-NH2) group of the next amino acid','All of them','NEW','11-151',NULL,'/ncert/pyq/physics/mcq/90701q.png'),
(90702,'biology','The process of formation peptide bond in a protein is called as','Dehydration','amino acids are linked by a peptide bond which is formed when the carboxyl (-COOH) group of one amino acid reacts with the amino (-NH2) group of the next amino acid with the elimination of a water moiety (the process is called dehydration(Reference  :NCERT Biology Class 11; page no:151, paragraph no:1)','Cell Structure And Functions >> Biomolecules >> Nature of Bond Linking Monomers in a Polymer',NULL,'3','mcq','Dehydration','Hydration','Oxidation','Carboxylation','NEW','11-151',NULL,'/ncert/pyq/physics/mcq/90702q.png'),
