(310705,'biology','Which of the following is not a desired plant trait?','Low resistance to pests','If we were to list the traits or characters that the breeders have tried to incorporate into crop plants, the first we would list would be increased crop yield and improved quality. Increased tolerance to environmental stresses (salinity, extreme temperatures, drought), resistance to pathogens (viruses, fungi and bacteria) and increased tolerance to insect pests would be on our list too.','Biology in Human Welfare >> Strategies for enhancement in food production >> What is Plant Breeding?',NULL,'3','mcq','High resistance to fungi','High yield','Low resistance to pests','High resistance to temperatures','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
