(290325,'chemistry','Polymer which is capable of softening on heating is','Polythene','Polythenes are linear or slightly branched long chain molecules. These are capable of repeatedly softening on heating and hardening on cooling and are thus thermoplastic polymers.\n \n Reference : (NCERT Class-12 Page- 435 Paragraph-3)','Organic chemistry >> Polymers >> Types of polymerisation reactions',NULL,'1','mcq','Teflon','PAN','Polythene','All of the above','DELETED',NULL,NULL,'/ncert/pyq/biology/mcq/290325q.png'),
(290326,'chemistry','Polythene are capable of','hardening on cooling','Polythenes are linear or slightly branched long chain molecules. \n \n These are capable of repeatedly softening on heating and hardening on cooling and are thus thermoplastic polymers.\n \n Reference : (NCERT Class-12 Page- 435 Paragraph-3)','Organic chemistry >> Polymers >> Types of polymerisation reactions',NULL,'1','mcq','softhening on cooling','hardening on cooling','hardening on heating','None of the above','DELETED',NULL,NULL,'/ncert/pyq/biology/mcq/290326q.png'),
