(290331,'chemistry','Identify the polymer whose general structure is given in diagram(n2908)','Low density polythene','LDP polymers have straight chain structure with some branches so known as branched polymer.\n \n Reference : (NCERT Class-12 Page- 435 Paragraph-4)','Organic chemistry >> Polymers >> Types of polymerisation reactions',NULL,'3','mcq','teflon','Low density polythene','High density polythene','terylene','DELETED',NULL,NULL,'/ncert/pyq/chemistry/mcq/290331q.png'),
