(290512,'biology','_________ and _________ are the two key concepts of Darwinian Theory of Evolution.','Branching descent, Natural selection','Branching descent and natural selection are the two key concepts of the Darwinian Theory of Evolution.','Genetics and Evolution >> Evolution >> Biological Evolution','Evolution','3','mcq','Radiating descent, Artificial selection','Branching descent, Natural selection','Branching descent, Darwinism','Artificial descent, Darwinism','NEW','12-134','12-117',NULL),
