(290514,'biology','Even before Darwin, a French naturalist _________ had said that evolution of life forms had occurred.','Lamarck','Even before Darwin, a French naturalist Lamarck had said that the evolution of life forms had occurred.','Genetics and Evolution >> Evolution >> Biological Evolution','Evolution','3','mcq','Lamarck','Malthus','Linnaeus','Hutton','NEW','12-134','12-117',NULL),
(290515,'biology','___________ gave the examples of Giraffes who in an attempt to forage leaves on tall trees had to adapt by elongation of their necks.','Lamarck','He gave the examples of Giraffes who in an attempt to forage leaves on tall trees had to adapt by elongation of their necks.','Genetics and Evolution >> Evolution >> Biological Evolution','Evolution','3','mcq','Linnaeus','Hutton','Lamarck','Darwin','NEW','12-135','12-118',NULL),
(290516,'biology','Evolution and natural selection are considered as all except ________.','End result of known processes','When we see present-day animals and the past we can\'t predict how these animals will end up like this. we can\'t say it\'s a workflow or a well-organized process. for us it\'s just a result of an unknown or unexplained process','Genetics and Evolution >> Evolution >> Biological Evolution','Evolution','2','mcq','Spontaneous Creation','Spontaneous generation','Energy flow','End result of known processes','NEW','12-135','12-118',NULL),
