(290518,'biology','_______ and ______ indicate competition for resources.','Maximal reproduction, Limited population size','The fact that theoretically population size will grow exponentially if everybody reproduced maximally (this fact can be seen in a growing bacterial population) and the fact that population sizes,, in reality are limited, means that there had been competition for resources.','Genetics and Evolution >> Evolution >> Biological Evolution','Evolution','3','mcq','Minimal reproduction, Limited population size','Maximal reproduction, Limited population size','Maximal reproduction, Growing population size','Maximal reproduction, Declining population size','NEW','12-135','12-118',NULL),
