(290813,'chemistry','Of the following which one is classified as polyester polymer?','Terylene','Terylene (Dacron) is a polyester polymer because it is made by monomer units ethylene glycol and terephthalic acid.\n \n Reference : (NCERT Class-12 Page- 438 Paragraph-2)','Organic chemistry >> Polymers >> Previous year questions',NULL,'1','mcq','Terylene','teflon','nylon 6, 6','melamine','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
