(290817,'chemistry','Which one of the following polymers is prepared by condensation polymerisation?','Nylon-6,6','Nylon 6,6: \n \n It is prepared by the condensation polymerisation of hexamethylenediamine with adipic acid under high pressure and at high temperature.\n \n Reference : (NCERT Class-12 Page- 437 Paragraph-5)','Organic chemistry >> Polymers >> Previous year questions',NULL,'1','mcq','teflon','Nylon-6,6','styrene','Neoprene','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
