(21038,'biology','Lichens are well known combination of an alga and a fungus where fungus has\n(2004)','(d) a symbiotic relationship with alga.','NCERT XII: 27','Diversity In Living World >> Biological Classification >> Previous Year Questions 3',NULL,'3','mcq','(a) a saprophytic relationship with the alga','(b) an epiphytic relationship with the alga','(c) a parasitic relationship with alga','(d) a symbiotic relationship with alga.','NEW','11-027','11-021',NULL),
(21039,'biology','There exists a close association between the alga and the fungus within a lichens. The fungus','Provides protection, anchorage and absorption for the alga','NCERT XII: 27','Diversity In Living World >> Biological Classification >> Previous Year Questions 3',NULL,'3','mcq','Provides food for the alga','Provides protection, anchorage and absorption for the alga','Fixes the atmospheric nitrogen for the alga','Releases Oxygen for tha alga','NEW','11-027','11-021',NULL),
(21040,'biology','Which of the following statements is correct?','lichens do not grow in polluted areas','NCERT XII: 27','Diversity In Living World >> Biological Classification >> Previous Year Questions 3',NULL,'3','mcq','lichens do not grow in polluted areas','Alagal component of lichens is called mycobiont','Fungal component of lichens is called phycobiont','Lichens are not good pollution indicators','NEW','11-027','11-021',NULL),
