(30342,'biology','Which stage of mosses bear the sex organ?','Leafy stage','Leafy stage  of mosses bears the sex organs.(Reference  : NCERT Biology Class 11; Page 36; paragraph no. 2)','Diversity In Living World >> Plant Kingdom >> Bryophytes',NULL,'1','mcq','Leafy stage','Protonema stage','Bud stage','Secondary protonema','NEW',NULL,NULL,NULL),
