(340512,'biology','Before appearance of symptoms of disease due to a pathogen','pathogen is present in low concentration','However,\nvery low concentration of a bacteria or virus (at a time when the symptoms\nof the disease are not yet visible) can be detected by amplification of their\nnucleic acid by PCR.','Biotechnology and Its Applications >> Biotechnology And Its Applications >> Molecular Diagnosis','Biotechnology and its applications','2','mcq','pathogen is present in high concentration','pathogen is present in high concentration but is inactive','pathogen is present in low concentration','none of the above','NEW','12-212','12-183',NULL),
