(340702,'biology','Assertion: Going beyond the morality of ethical issues, the biological significance of such things and limiting research is also important. \n\nReason: Genetic modification of organisms can have unpredicatable results when such organisms are introduced into the ecosystem.','Both A and R are correct and R is correct reason for Assertion','Going beyond the morality of such issues, the biological significance of such things is also important. Genetic modification of organisms can have unpredicatable results when such organisms are introduced into the ecosystem.','Biotechnology and Its Applications >> Biotechnology And Its Applications >> Ethical Issues','Biotechnology and its applications','3','mcq','Both A and R are correct and R is correct reason for Assertion','A and R both are correct but R is not the correct reason for the Assertion','A and R, both are false','A is true and R is false','NEW','12-213','12-184',NULL),
