(340704,'biology','The Indian Government has set up organisations such as GEAC  which will make decisions regarding the validity of GM research and the safety of introducing GM-organisms for public services.What is the full form of GEAC?','Genetic Engineering Approval Committee','The Indian Government has set up organisations such as GEAC (Genetic Engineering Approval Committee), which will make decisions regarding the validity of GM research and the safety of introducing GM-organisms for public services.','Biotechnology and Its Applications >> Biotechnology And Its Applications >> Ethical Issues','Biotechnology and its applications','3','mcq','Genetic Engineering Application Committee','Genetic Engineering Applied Committee','Genetic Engineering Approval Committee','Genetic Engineering Applied Sciences Committee','NEW','12-213','12-184',NULL),
