(460104,'chemistry','According to Boyle\'s law at constant temperature, relation between the pressure and volume and is given by\n\nPV=Constant\nP₁V₁=P₂V₂  \n\nWhere P₁ and P₂ are pressures when the volumes are V₁ & V₂ at temperature \'T\'',NULL,NULL,'Physical Chemistry Formulae >> States of Matter >> Boyle\'s Law',NULL,'1','flashcard',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
