(460107,'chemistry','According to Charla\'s law at constant pressure, the relation between the volume and temperature is given by\n\nV/T= Constant \n\nV₁/T₁=V₂/T₂\n\nWhere V₁ and V₂ are volumes of gas at the given temperature T₁ and T₂ at constant Pressure P',NULL,NULL,'Physical Chemistry Formulae >> States of Matter >> Charla\'s Law',NULL,'1','flashcard',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
