(460110,'chemistry','According to Gay lussac\'s law, at constant volume, relation between pressure and volume is given by\n\nP/T = Constant \n\nP₁/T₁ = P₂/T₂\n\nWhere \nP=Pressure, \nT= temperature on kelvin scale',NULL,NULL,'Physical Chemistry Formulae >> States of Matter >> Gay lussac\'s Law',NULL,'1','flashcard',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'DELETED',NULL,NULL,'/ncert/pyq/physics/mcq/460110q.png'),
