(470101,'chemistry','The mathematical statement of 1st law of Thermodynamics is given by\n\nΔv=q+w\n\nWhere \nΔv=change in internal energy, \nq=Heat absorbed/given by system, \nw=work done',NULL,NULL,'Physical Chemistry Formulae >> Thermodynamics >> First law of Thermodynamics',NULL,'1','flashcard',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'NEW',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(470102,'chemistry','Match the formula to with respect to 1st law of Thermodynamics','ΔU-change in internal energy, q-Heat change, w-work done',NULL,'Physical Chemistry Formulae >> Thermodynamics >> First law of Thermodynamics',NULL,'1','match','ΔU,change in internal energy','q,Heat change','w,work done',NULL,'NEW',NULL,NULL,NULL),
