(470128,'chemistry','The relation between Cₚ and Cᵥ is given by\n\nCₚ-Cᵥ=R\n\nWhere \nCᵥ=Molar heat cap. at constant volume, \nCₚ=Molar heat cap. at constant pressure, \nR=Universal gas constant',NULL,NULL,'Physical Chemistry Formulae >> Thermodynamics >> Relation Between Cₚ and Cᵥ (Mayer\'s Equation)',NULL,'1','flashcard',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'NEW',NULL,NULL,'/ncert/pyq/physics/mcq/470128q.png'),
