(470137,'chemistry','The mathematical equation of the hess law of constant heat summation is given by\n  ⊖\nΔHₛₜₑₚₛ=ΔH₁+ΔH₂+ΔH₃.... \nr ⊖          ⊖\nΔHₔᵢᵣₑ꜀ₜ=ΔHₛₜₑₚₛ\n r           r\n\nWhere \nΔHₛₜₑₚₛ=Summation of heat change in each step, \nΔHₔᵢᵣₑ꜀ₜ=Total heat change during 1st to last step of process',NULL,NULL,'Physical Chemistry Formulae >> Thermodynamics >> Hess Law of Constant Summation',NULL,'1','flashcard',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'NEW',NULL,NULL,NULL),
