(510122,'chemistry','The relation between partial pressure and mole fraction of gas as given by Henry\'s law is\n\nP=Kₕx\n\nWhere \nP=Partial pressure of gas in vapour phase, \nx=Mole fraction of gas in solution, \nKₕ=Henry\'s constant, \nKₕ∝⊥ solubility of gas',NULL,NULL,'Physical Chemistry Formulae >> Solutions >> Henry\'s Law',NULL,'1','flashcard',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'NEW',NULL,NULL,'/ncert/pyq/physics/mcq/510122q.png'),
