(560190,'chemistry','Tollen\'s reagent is ammoniacal AgNO₃ solution. When aldehyde is heated with Tollen\'s reagent, aldehyde is oxidised to carboxylate ion and tollen\'s reagent gets reduced to bright silver mirror\n\nAgNO₃+NH₄OH-------> Ag₂O↓ + NH₄NO₃+H₂O\nAg₂O+NH₄OH-------->[Ag(NH₃)₂]⁺ OĤ + 3H₂O\nRCHO + [Ag(NH₃)₂]⁺ OĤ------->RCOO⁻ +Ag ↓+H₂O+ NH₃\n                                                           Silver mirror',NULL,NULL,'Organic Named Reaction >> Class 12 >> Tollen\'s Test',NULL,'1','flashcard',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'NEW',NULL,NULL,NULL),
