(100279,'chemistry','Which alkali metal is used in electrochemical cells?','Li','Li is used in electrochemical cells.\n\n(Reference- NCERT Chemistry Class 11 (Part 2); Page 302; Paragraph 10.1.7)','Inorganic chemistry >> The s Block Elements >> Group 1 elements- Properties and Uses',NULL,'1','mcq','Li','Na','K','Fr','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(100280,'chemistry','For which of the following Na/Pb alloys are not used?','NaEt','Sodium is used to make a Na/Pb alloy needed to make PbEt₄ and PbMe₄. \n\nThese organolead compounds were earlier used as anti-knock additives to petrol,\n\n(Reference- NCERT Chemistry Class 11 (Part 2); Page 302; Paragraph 10.1.7)','Inorganic chemistry >> The s Block Elements >> Group 1 elements- Properties and Uses',NULL,'2','mcq','PbEt₄','PbMe₄','Anti-knock additives for petrol','NaEt','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(100281,'chemistry','What are organolead compounds like PbEt₄ are used as?','Anti-knock additives for petrol','Organolead compounds were earlier used as anti-knock additives to petrol, but nowadays vehicles use lead-free petrol.\n\n(Reference- NCERT Chemistry Class 11 (Part 2); Page 302; Paragraph 10.1.7)','Inorganic chemistry >> The s Block Elements >> Group 1 elements- Properties and Uses',NULL,'1','mcq','Anti-knock additives for petrol','Coolants','Pesticide','Herbicide','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(100282,'chemistry','What is used as a coolant in fast breeder nuclear reactors?','Liquid sodium metal','Liquid sodium metal is used as a coolant in fast breeder nuclear reactors.\n\n(Reference- NCERT Chemistry Class 11 (Part 2); Page 302; Paragraph 10.1.7)','Inorganic chemistry >> The s Block Elements >> Group 1 elements- Properties and Uses',NULL,'1','mcq','Liquid sodium metal','Gaseous sodium','Liquid potassium','Gaseous potassium','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(100283,'chemistry','What is KCl is used as/in?','Fertilizer','Potassium chloride is used as a fertilizer.\n\n(Reference- NCERT Chemistry Class 11 (Part 2); Page 302; Paragraph 10.1.7)','Inorganic chemistry >> The s Block Elements >> Group 1 elements- Properties and Uses',NULL,'1','mcq','Fertilizer','Coolant in fast breeder nuclear reactor','Anti knock additive to petrol','Electrochemical cells','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
