(100285,'chemistry','What does Potassium hydroxide function as?','CO₂ absorbent','Potassium hydroxide functions as Carbon dioxide absorber.\n\n(Reference- NCERT Chemistry Class 11 (Part 2); Page 302; Paragraph 10.1.7)','Inorganic chemistry >> The s Block Elements >> Group 1 elements- Properties and Uses',NULL,'1','mcq','CO₂ absorbent','Fertilizer','Herbicide','Anti knock additive','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
