(100763,'chemistry','Which among the following are not attacked readily by air to form Nitride and Oxide?','Mg','Calcium, Strontium and Barium are readily attacked by air to form the Oxide and Nitride.\n \n(Reference- NCERT Chemistry Class 11 (Part 2); Page 308; Paragraph 10.6.6)','Inorganic chemistry >> The s Block Elements >> Group 2 Elements- Properties and Uses',NULL,'2','mcq','Mg','Ca','Sr','Ba','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
