(250962,'chemistry','Which one is formed when sodium phenoxide is heated with ethyl iodide?','Phenetole','Phenetole is formed when sodium phenoxide is heated with ethyl iodide.\nNEET 1998','Organic Chemistry >> Alcohols, Phenols and Ether >> Previous Year Question',NULL,'1','mcq','Phenetole','Ethyl phenyl alcohol','Phenol','None of these','NEW','12-342','12-212',NULL),
