(290341,'chemistry','The polymer that is used for manufacturing buckets, dustbins, bottles, pipes?','High density polythene','High density polymers are also chemically inert and more tough and hard. It is used for manufacturing buckets, dustbins, bottles, pipes, etc.\n \n Reference : (NCERT Class-12 Page- 436 Paragraph-2)','Organic chemistry >> Polymers >> Types of polymerisation reactions',NULL,'1','mcq','melamine','Low density polythene','High density polythene','teflon','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(290342,'chemistry','Teflon is manufactured by heating','tetrafluoroethene','Teflon is manufactured by heating tetrafluoroethene with a free radical or persulphate catalyst at high pressures.\n \n Reference : (NCERT Class-12 Page- 436 Paragraph-3)','Organic chemistry >> Polymers >> Types of polymerisation reactions',NULL,'1','mcq','tetrafluoroethane','tetrafluoromethylene','tetrafluoroethene','tetrafluoromethane','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
