(290344,'chemistry','Which of them is resistant to attack by corrosive agents ?','Teflon','It is chemically inert and resistant to attack by corrosive reagents. \n \n It is used in making oil seals and gaskets and also used for non – stick surface coated utensils.\n \n Reference : (NCERT Class-12 Page- 436 Paragraph-3)','Organic chemistry >> Polymers >> Types of polymerisation reactions',NULL,'1','mcq','Polythene','Teflon','Polyacrylonitrile','Polyacrylonitrile','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
