(290347,'chemistry','Monomer used for formation of polyacrylonitile is ?','Acrylonitrile','The addition polymerisation of acrylonitrile in presence of a peroxide catalyst leads to the formation of polyacrylonitrile.\n \n Reference : (NCERT Class-12 Page- 436 Paragraph-4)','Organic chemistry >> Polymers >> Types of polymerisation reactions',NULL,'1','mcq','Acrylonitrile','tetrafluoromethylene','tetrafluoroethene','Acrylonitrate','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
