(290436,'chemistry','Identify the product in the given diagram(n2923)','neoprene','Neoprene or polychloroprene is formed by the free radical polymerisation of chloroprene.\n \n Reference : (NCERT Class-12 Page- 441 Paragraph-4)','Organic chemistry >> Polymers >> Types of polymerisation reactions-2',NULL,'3','mcq','isoprene','chloroprene','neoprene','styrene','DELETED',NULL,NULL,'/ncert/pyq/chemistry/mcq/290436q.png'),
