(281234,'chemistry','Haemoglobin is ____.','a globular protein','Haemoglobin is a globular protein of four subunits, each subunit having a heme moiety and a polypeptide chain (Two α and two β chains).\n (1997)','Organic chemistry >> Biomolecules >> Previous year question',NULL,'1','mcq','a vitamin','a carbohydrate','an enzyme','a globular protein','NEW','12-424','12-294',NULL),
