(281246,'chemistry','In DNA, the linkages between different nitrogenous bases are?','H-bonding','Nitrogenous bases are linked together by hydrogen bonds.\n (Karnataka NEET 2013)','Organic chemistry >> Biomolecules >> Previous year question',NULL,'2','mcq','Phosphate linkage','H-bonding','Glycosidic linkage','Peptide linkage.','NEW','12-429','12-299',NULL),
