(112310,'chemistry','All members of C-family can extend their covalence more than four except','C','C do not have d subshell while all other members hav d or f-subshell,\n which increase their co-ordination no.\n Reference: (NCERT Chemistry Class 11;Page 324; Paragraph No.2)','Inorganic Chemistry >> The p-Block elements >> Group 14-elements-Oxidation state and trends in chemical reactivity',NULL,'2','mcq','C','Ge','Sn','Pb','NEW','11-324',NULL,NULL),
