(300248,'chemistry','If noradrenaline level in blood is very low then person suffers from','Depression','Noradrenaline is one of the neurotransmitters that plays a role in mood changes. If the level of noradrenaline is low for some reason, then the signal-sending activity becomes low, and the person suffers from depression.(Reference: NCERT Chemistry Class 12; Page 452 Para 2 )','Organic Chemistry >> Chemistry in everydaylife >> Therapeutic action of different classes of Drugs',NULL,'1','mcq','Erythroblastofeotalis','Pain','Depression','Dengue','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
