(213502,'chemistry','In laboratory, HCl is prepared by heating __________ with concentrated sulphuric acid.','sodium chloride','In laboratory, HCl is prepared by heating sodium chloride with concentrated sulphuric acid. \nNaCl + H₂SO₄ → NaHSO₄ + HCl\nNaHSO₄ + NaCl →  Na₂SO₄ + HCl\n(Reference\' (NCERT Chemistry Class 12 Page No. 204 Paragraph No. 2)','Inorganic chemistry >> The p-Block Elements >> Hydrogen Chloride',NULL,'2','mcq','potassium chloride','sodium chloride','nitric acid','calcium chloride','NEW','12-204',NULL,NULL),
