(214289,'chemistry','Match the name of the process given in column 1 with the name of the compound given in the column 2 and mark the correct option\n1- Pure Nitrogen           (i) Chlorine\n2- Haber Process         (ii) Sulphuric acid\n3- Contact Process       (iii) Ammonia\n4- Deacon\'s Process     (iv) Sodium Azide or Barium Azide','(iv) (iii) (ii) (i)','Neet2019','Inorganic chemistry >> The p-Block Elements >> Previous year questions',NULL,'2','mcq','(iv) (iii) (ii) (i)','(i) (ii) (iii) (iv)','(ii) (iv) (i) (iii)','(iii) (iv) (ii) (i)','NEW','12-176',NULL,NULL),
