(214291,'chemistry','The incorrect statement regarding oxacids of phosphorus is','Hypophosphorus acid is diprotic acid','NEET2012','Inorganic chemistry >> The p-Block Elements >> Previous year questions',NULL,'1','mcq','Orthophosphorus acid is used in the manufacturig of triplesuperphosphate','Hypophosphorus acid is diprotic acid','All oxacids contains tetrahedral four coordinated phosphorus.','All oxacids contains atleast one P=O unit and one P-OH group.','NEW','12-185',NULL,NULL),
(214292,'chemistry','The correct Statement about given acid is','Phosphinic acid is a monoprotic acid while phosphonic acid is a diprotic acid','NEET2016','Inorganic chemistry >> The p-Block Elements >> Previous year questions',NULL,'1','mcq','Phosphinic acid is a monoprotic acid while phosphonic acid is a diprotic acid','phosphinic acid is a diprotic acid while phosphonic acid is a monoprotic acid','Both are triprotic acids.','Both are diprotic acids','NEW','12-185',NULL,NULL),
