(214360,'chemistry','Which P-block compound/element is reducing in behaviour?','SO₂','Only SO₂ is reducing in nature. \n(Reference\' (NCERT Chemistry Class 12 Page no. 194 Paragraph 2)','Inorganic chemistry >> The p-Block Elements >> Most challenging questions',NULL,'2','mcq','Cl₂','SO₂','H₂SO₄','HNO₃','NEW','12-194',NULL,NULL),
