(71731,'chemistry','The pH of 0.001 M aniline solution is 7.82. The ionization constant of aniline is 4.27 × 10⁻¹⁰. Calculate the degree of ionization of aniline in the solution.','6.53 × 10⁻⁴','Refer diagram(ne0735)','Physical Chemistry >> Equilibrium >> NCERT Exercise',NULL,'2','mcq','6.53 × 10⁻⁴','6.53 × 10⁻⁴³','6.53 × 10⁻³','6.53','NEW','11-221','11-197',NULL),
