(42250,'chemistry','Correct sequence of increasing covalent character is represented by','NaCl, LiCI, BeCl ₂','Smaller, the size and higher the magnitude of charge on cation more is the covalent character. (Reference : NCERT Class 11 part 1 page 107 topic 4.2 Paragraph 3)','Inorganic chemistry >> Chemical bonding and molecular structure >> Advanced Questions',NULL,'1','mcq','LiCI, NaCl, BeCl ₂','BeCl ₂ , NaCl, LiCl','NaCl, LiCI, BeCl ₂','BeCl ₂ , LiCI, NaCl','NEW','11-106','11-106',NULL),
(42251,'chemistry','What is not true about resonance?','Hybrid structure is least stable.','As compared to resonating structures, resonance, hybrid has the least energy and hence most stable. (Reference : NCERT Class 11 part 1 page 105 topic 4.3.5 Paragraph 2)','Inorganic chemistry >> Chemical bonding and molecular structure >> Advanced Questions',NULL,'1','mcq','The resonating structures are hypothetical.','The unpaired electrons in various resonating structures are same.','Hybrid structure is least stable.','Hybrid structure is least energetic.','NEW','11-109','11-109',NULL),
