(70,'biology',100,552,1106,'Identify the correct alphabet depicting site of fertilisation and site of implantation.','[{"text": "${\\\\rm{Z}}\\\\,{\\\\rm{ - }}\\\\,{\\\\rm{fallopian}}\\\\,{\\\\rm{tube,}}\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\rm{X - uterus}}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{X}}\\\\,{\\\\rm{ - }}\\\\,{\\\\rm{uterus,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,Y{\\\\rm{ - ovary}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{Z}}\\\\,{\\\\rm{ - }}\\\\,{\\\\rm{fallopian}}\\\\,{\\\\rm{tube,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,Y{\\\\rm{ - ovary}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$Y{\\\\rm{ - ovary,}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,\\\\,{\\\\rm{Z}}\\\\,{\\\\rm{ - }}\\\\,{\\\\rm{fallopian}}\\\\,{\\\\rm{tube}}$", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Z- fallopian tube(fertilisation) X- Uterus<br>( implantation)',NULL,'Easy','MCQ type-3',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508','biology/100_70_question_1.png'),
(83,'biology',100,552,1106,'The main function of fimbriae of fallopian tube is<br>','[{"text": "Help in development of ovary during ovarian cycle<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Help in release of ovum during ovarian cycle<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Help in the development of corpus luteum after ovulation<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Help in collection of ovum after ovulation", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'The ciliary action of the fimbriae of fallopian tube helps to collect and move ovum to fertilization site.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(84,'biology',100,552,1106,'Choose the incorrect pair.<br>','[{"text": "Finger-like projections - Infundibulum<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Narrow part of oviduct - Ampulla<br>", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Part of oviduct joining the uterus - Isthmus<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Epithelium of fallopian tube - ciliated", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Ampulla is the wider part of Oviduct',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(85,'biology',100,552,1106,'The wall of uterus consists of<br>','[{"text": "Inner thin membranous perimetrium: it consists of smooth muscle fibres.<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Middle myometrium: it consists of smooth muscle fibres.<br>", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Outer endometrium:it consists of striated muscle fibres.<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Middle myometrium: it consists of striated muscle fibres.", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Middle myometrium: it consists of smooth muscle fibres.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(86,'biology',100,552,1106,'External thin membranous layer of uterus is known as','[{"text": "Myometrium", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Pericardium", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Perimetrium", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Endometrium", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'The wall of the uterus has three layers of tissue. The external thin membranous perimetrium.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(87,'biology',100,552,1106,'The endometrium is the lining of','[{"text": "Oviduct", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Vagina", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Uterus", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Bladder", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Uterus has three parts viz. perimetrium, myometrium and endometrium. Endometrium is the innermost part which forms the lining of the uterine cavity and undergoes cyclical changes during ovarian cycle.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(88,'biology',100,552,1106,'The layer of uterine tissues responsible for strong contractions during childbirth is','[{"text": "Perimetrium", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Mesometrium", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Mesoderm", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Myocardium", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'The myometrium exhibits strong contraction during delivery of the baby.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(89,'biology',100,552,1106,'Which layer of uterus undergoes cyclic changes during menstrual cycle?','[{"text": "Mesoderm", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Myometrium", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Endothelium", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Endometrium", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'The endometrium undergoes cyclical changes during menstrual cycle.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(90,'biology',100,552,1106,'Starting from uterus, which among the following is the correct sequence?','[{"text": "Isthmus - Fimbriae - Ampulla - Infumdibulum.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Isthmus - Ampulla - Infumdibulum - Fimbriae.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Isthmus - Fimbriae- Infumdibulum - Ampulla", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Isthmus - Ampulla - Fimbriae - Infumdibulum", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'The correct sequence starting from the uterus is- Isthmus, Ampulla, Infundibulum, Fimbriae.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(91,'biology',100,552,1106,'Which among the following is muscular?','[{"text": "Perimetrium", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Endometrium", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Myometrium", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "2 and 3 both", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'The muscular layer of uterus is Myometrium',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(92,'biology',100,552,1106,'Name the type of muscle present in the middle layer of the uterus.','[{"text": "Smooth muscle", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Striated muscle", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Voluntary muscle", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Striped muscle", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'The myometrium exhibits strong contraction duringdelivery of the baby.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(93,'biology',100,552,1106,'Match the columns.<br><div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">A. Perimetrium<br>B. Myometrium<br>C. Endometrium</div><div class="column-right">P. Muscular wall of uterus<br>Q. Inner lining of uterus<br>R. Outer wall of uterus</div></div>','[{"text": "$\\\\mathrm{A}-\\\\mathrm{R}, \\\\mathrm{B}-\\\\mathrm{P}, \\\\mathrm{C}-\\\\mathrm{Q}$<br>", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{A}-\\\\mathrm{Q}, \\\\mathrm{B}-\\\\mathrm{R}, \\\\mathrm{C}-\\\\mathrm{P}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{A}-\\\\mathrm{P},  \\\\mathrm{B}-\\\\mathrm{R}, \\\\mathrm{C}-\\\\mathrm{Q}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{A}-\\\\mathrm{Q}, \\\\mathrm{B}-\\\\mathrm{P}, \\\\mathrm{C}-\\\\mathrm{R}$", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'A-R, B-P, C-Q.',NULL,'Easy','Match the following',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(94,'biology',100,552,1106,'Cervix occurs in','[{"text": "Kidney", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Uterus", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Between uterus and vagina", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Between vulva and vagina", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'In the female, the vulva leads to the vagina, which then leads to cervix and then the uterus. Cervix along with vagina forms the birth-canal.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(95,'biology',100,552,1106,'Cervical canal is  ____ <br>','[{"text": "Passage of urinary bladder to outside.<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Passage of uterus to vagina<br>", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Passage of uterus to fallopian tube.<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Hollow passage in cervical vertebrae to accomodate the spinal cord.", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Cervical canal is the passage of uterus to vagina.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(96,'biology',100,552,1106,'Identify the correct statement?','[{"text": "Vagina - birth canal", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Mammary glands - secretion of prolactin", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Urethra - absent in females", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "All of these", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Vagina is non glandular.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(97,'biology',100,552,1106,'The only statement correct about hymen is<br>','[{"text": "It is an opening of uterus<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "It is a reliable indicator of virginity<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "It is always torn after first coitus.<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "It can be broken by a sudden fall or jolt, insertion of vaginal tampon, cycling, etc.", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'The hymen is often torn during the first coitus (intercourse), by sudden fall or jolt, insertion of vaginal tampon, cycling etc.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(98,'biology',100,552,1106,'Identify A, B, C, D.<br>','[{"text": "A - ovary,B - cervix, $\\\\mathrm{C}$ - vagina,$\\\\mathrm{D}$ - uterus", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A - uterus, B - cervix, C - vagina, D - fallopian tube.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A - ovary, B - uterus, $\\\\mathrm{C}$ - vagina, D - Cervix", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A - ovary, B - vagina, C - cervix, $\\\\mathrm{D}$ - uterus", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'NCERT figure 3.3(b).',NULL,'Easy','MCQ type-3',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508','biology/100_98_question_1.png'),
(99,'biology',100,552,1106,'Clitoris in female mammal is<br>3','[{"text": "Non functional", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Over grown structure", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Analogous to penis of male", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Homologous to penis of male", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'It is homologous to the corpora cavernosa in penis of male.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(100,'biology',100,552,1106,'Among clitoris, hymen, Vagina, Cervix, labia minora and mons pubis, how many are part of external genitalia (vulva) in females.','[{"text": "3", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "4", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "2", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "6", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'4 Clitoris, hymen, labia minora and mons pubis, are part of external genitalia (vulva) in females',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(101,'biology',100,552,1106,'Which group represents the external genitalia<br>','[{"text": "Labium minora, labium majora and clitoris<br>", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Labium minora, labium majora and vagina<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Labium minora, labium majora and cervix<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Labium minora, labium majora and oviduct", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Labium minora, labium majora and clitoris form the external genitalia in females.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(102,'biology',100,552,1106,'Which gland in female is a counterpart of Cowper\'s gland in male?','[{"text": "Perineal gland", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Clitoris", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Bartholin\'s gland", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "None of these", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'In females Bartholin\'s gland is found which resembles the Cowper\'s gland present in males.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(103,'biology',100,552,1106,'Hymen can be torn or broken by<br>(i) First coitus<br>(ii) Sudden fall or jolt<br>(iii) Horse riding<br>(iv) Cycling<br>(v) Insertion of a vaginal tampon<br>','[{"text": "i, ii, and iv only <br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "iii, iv, and v only<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "i, iv and v only<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "All of these", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'All of these',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(104,'biology',100,552,1106,'Choose the correct pair.<br>','[{"text": "Cushion of fatty tissue covered by pubic hair - Labia majora<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Membrane covering opening of vagina Mons pubis<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "The labia minora are paired folds of tissue under the labia majora<br>", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Uterine layer exhibiting strong contraction during delivery - Endometrium", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Mons pubis is a cushion of fattytissue covered by skin and pubic hair.The opening of the vagina is often covered partially by a membrane called hymen.<br>The labia minora are paired folds of tissue under the labia majora. Uterine layer exhibiting strong contraction during delivery-Myometrium.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL);
