(105,'biology',100,552,1106,'In breast, the mammary gland, the milk is sucked out through<br>','[{"text": "Mammary duct<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Mammary tubule<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Mammary ampulla<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Lactiferous duct", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Several mammary ducts join to form a wider mammary ampulla which is connected to lactiferous duct through which milk is sucked out.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
