(151,'biology',103,964,2246,'A disease which can easily transmit from one person to another is called','[{"text": "Non-infection disease", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Infectious disease", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Pathogenic disease", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Life style disease", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Diseases which are easily transmitted from one person to another, are called infectious diseases. Infectious diseases are very common and every one of us suffers from these at sometime or other. Some of the infectious diseases like AIDS are fatal.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
