(521,'biology',103,965,2247,'<i>Entamoeba</i> histolytica is a parasite, which body part does it affect?','[{"text": "Stomach", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Liver", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Small intestine of human", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Large intestine of human", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'<i>Entamoeba histolytica</i> is a protozoan parasite in the large intestine of human which causes amoebiasis (amoebic dysentery).<br>Symptoms of this disease include constipation, abdominal pain and cramps, stools with excess mucous and blood clots.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(523,'biology',100,554,1109,'Which one is an incorrect statement?<br>','[{"text": "Menstrual cycle takes 28 days<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Menopause occurs at 45-55 years<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Menstruation takes 4 days<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "During pregnancy ovulation continues", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'During pregnancy there is no ovulation a s the corpus luteum keeps on secrete progesterone to sustain the pregnancy.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
