(525,'biology',103,965,2247,'<i>Entamoeba</i> belongs to which kingdom?','[{"text": "Kingdom Monera- Protozoa", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Kingdom Protista- Protozoa", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Kingdom Protista- Dinoflagellates", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Kingdom Animalia- Protozoa", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'<i>Entamoeba histolytica</i> are pathogenic amoeba that are widely known for causing intestinal and extraintestinal infections in human beings. Entamoeba histolytica falls under the kingdom protista, the phylum Protozoa, the class Sarcodina and the order Lobosa.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
