(559,'biology',103,965,2247,'Identify the correct statement<br>i. <i>Plasmodium</i> is a sporozoite while <i>Entamoeba</i> is a protist<br>ii. <i>Plasmodium</i> is a protist while <i>Entamoeba</i> is a protozoa','[{"text": "Only i is correct", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Only ii is correct", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both are correct", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "None are correct", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'<i>Entamoeba histolytica</i> is a protozoan parasite belonging to kingdom protista. Plasmodium is a tiny protozoan from kingdom protista, Plasmodium enters the human body as sporozoites (infectious form)',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
