(653,'biology',100,555,1112,'At the time of implantation the human embryo is called','[{"text": "Embryo", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Blastocyst", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Morula", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Foetus", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'The blastula transforms into a blastocyst after the formation of blastocoel cavity. Now the blastocyst hatches from zona pellucida and embeds into the uterine lining.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
