(722,'biology',103,966,2248,'The two types of immunity in humans are','[{"text": "Overt and covert", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Intrinsic and extrinsic", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Internal and external", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Innate and the acquired", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Immunity received by birth and developed after exposure.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(723,'biology',105,1281,3098,'Population of any species is','[{"text": "A static process", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A dynamic process", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both (1) and (2)", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "None of them", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Population of any species is a dynamic process.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(724,'biology',106,1352,3254,'Genetic diversity is related to','[{"text": "Types of species within an ecosystem", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Different communities in an area", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Gene based diversity", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Diversity of a genus", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Genetic diversity refers to the diversity (or genetic variability) within species. Each individual species possesses genes which are the source of its own unique features.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(725,'biology',100,556,1114,'In human embryonic development, which layer develops between the ectoderm and endoderm?','[{"text": "Mesothelium", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Mesoderm", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Chorion", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Myometrium", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Mesoderm develops between the ectoderm and endoderm.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(726,'biology',103,966,2248,'Another name for innate immunity','[{"text": "Is explicit immunity", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Is non-specific immunity", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Is specific immunity", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Is immunity", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Innate immunity is non-specific type of defence, that is present at the time of birth. This is accomplished by providing different types of barriers to the entry of the foreign agents into our body.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(727,'biology',106,1352,3254,'The amount of genetic variation is the basis of:','[{"text": "Adaptation", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Speciation", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Mutation", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "None of these", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Speciation: Evolution of new species.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(728,'biology',105,1281,3098,'Population density of a population in a given habitat during a given period fluctuates due to the change in','[{"text": "Natality and mortality", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Immigration and emigration", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both of them", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "None of these", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Population density of a population in a given habitat during a given period fluctuates due to the change in<br>(1) Natality and mortality<br>(2) Immigration and Emigration',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
