(733,'biology',100,556,1114,'By the end of first trimester, which of the following has occurred in the foetus.<br>','[{"text": "Body is covered with fine hair.<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Foetal movements begin<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "The brain of foetus is fully developed<br>", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Rudimentary organs are formed.", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Rudimentary organs are formed by the end of first trimester.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(734,'biology',103,966,2248,'An antibody is','[{"text": "Phagocyte", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Molecule that are prodcued in antigenic response.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Component of $\\\\mathrm{RBC}$ in antigenic response.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Component of blood in antigenic response.", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'The B-lymphocytes produce an army of proteins in response to pathogens into our blood to fight with them. These proteins are called antibodies.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(735,'biology',106,1352,3254,'How many strains of rice is found in India?','[{"text": "20000", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "40000", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "50000", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "30000", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'There are more than 50,000 varieties of cultivated rice (the grass species <em>Oryza sativa</em>) said to exist in India. But the exact figure is uncertain. Over 90,000 samples of cultivated rice and wild species are stored at the International Rice Gene Bank and these are used by researchers all over the world.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
