(767,'biology',106,1353,3255,'Which of the following represent maximum number of species among global diversity?','[{"text": "Fungi", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Mosses and ferns", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Bacteria", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Ferns and allies", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Fungi represents maximum number of species among global diversity. There are about 5.1 million fungal species according to recent estimates by mycologists.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
