(769,'biology',100,556,1114,'When does the inner cell mass differentiates?','[{"text": "Immediately after fertilisation", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Immediately after implantation", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Immediately after ovulation", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Immediately after parturition", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Immediately after implantation, the inner cell mass (embryo) differentiates',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(770,'biology',105,1281,3098,'The human population first began to grow exponentially at the time of','[{"text": "Tool using revolution", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Agricultural revolution", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Industrial revolution", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "First world war", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'With the introduction of agricultural revolution better crops were raised which accelerated the growth of human population.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(771,'biology',103,966,2248,'Which of the following is not a component of innate immunity?','[{"text": "Interferon", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$\\\\mathrm{HCl}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Skin", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Antibodies", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Antibodies are the component which does not participate in innate immunity. The antibodies are part of innate immunity which gets activated after exposure to the pathogens. Antibodies are like special bodyguards that only recognize certain germs. Natural immunity triggers your immune system to make antibodies against the germ causing the infection inside of you. Innate immunity is the host\'s first line of defence and is intended to prevent infection and attack the invading pathogens.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(772,'biology',106,1353,3255,'The following figure represents the global biodiversity of proportionate number of major taxa of Vertebrates. Identify the major group, which is species rich amongst them?','[{"text": "Fishes", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Amphibians", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Mammals", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Reptiles", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Fishes occupy the greatest number among vertebrates. Fig 15.1',NULL,'Easy','MCQ type-3',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508','biology/106_772_question_1.png'),
