(774,'biology',103,966,2248,'First line of defense of immunity includes','[{"text": "Skin", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Mucus", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both 1 & 2", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "NK cells", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Innate immunity is the host\'s first line of defence and is intended to prevent infection and attack the invading pathogens. Innate immunity comprises different components including physical barriers (skin) ; anatomical barriers ; epithelial mucous lining and phagocytic cell enzymes, phagocytes, monocytes etc.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
