(1159,'biology',100,553,1107,'<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left">Head of sperm consists of acrosome and mitochondria.<br></div><div class="column-right">Acrosome contains a spiral row of mitochondria.<br></div></div>','[{"text": "Statement A is correct but Statement B is incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Statement A is incorrect but Statement B is correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both statements are correct.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Statements are incorrect.", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Head of a sperm contains nucleus and acrosome. The middle piece of the sperm contains a spiral row of mitochondria along with ring centriole, with proximal & distal centriole',NULL,'Medium','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
