(1198,'biology',106,1357,3260,'Which of the following comes under the broadly utilitarian reasons for conserving biodiversity<br>i. Industrial product<br>ii. Oxygen<br>iii. Pollination<br>iv. Bioprospecting<br>v. Drugs<br>vi. Aesthetic pleasure<br>vii. Fibre and firewood','[{"text": "ii, iii, vi", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "ii, iii, iv, vi", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "i, ii, iii, vi", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "ii, iii, iv, vii", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Oxygen provision, pollination done by biotic agents and aesthetic pleasure comes under broad utilitarian use.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(1199,'biology',105,1283,3102,'Cuscuta, a parasite plant that is commonly found growing on hedge plants has lost its____and ____ in the course of evolution','[{"text": "Root and chlorophyll", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Chlorophyll and Leaves", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Root and leaves", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Leaves and stem", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Chlorophyll and Leaves',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(1200,'biology',100,554,1109,'<strong>Assertion:</strong> Graafian follicle ruptures and release ovum (ovulation).<br><br><strong>Reason:</strong> Rapid secretion of $\\mathrm{LH}$ leads to its maximum level during the midcycle called LH surge.','[{"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are correct and Reason is the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are correct but Reason is not the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Assertion is correct but Reason is incorrect.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are incorrect", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Both assertion and reason are correct and reason is the correct explanation of assertion.',NULL,'Medium','Assertion and Reason',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(1201,'biology',103,967,2254,'MALT constitutes about ____ percent of the lymphoid tissue in human body.','[{"text": "$50 \\\\%$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$20 \\\\%$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$70 \\\\%$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$10 \\\\%$", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'There is lymphoid tissue also located within the lining of the major tracts (respiratory, digestive and urogenital tracts) called mucosaassociated lymphoid tissue (MALT). It constitutes about 50 per cent of the lymphoid tissue in human body.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(1202,'biology',106,1355,3258,'Consider the following statements w.r.t biodiversity<br>I. Within a region species richness increased with increasing explored area, but only upto a limit<br>II. Relatively more constant environment of the tropics promote niche specialization and leads to lesser species diversity<br>III. Keystone species drive major ecosystem functions<br>IV. A stable community must be resistant to invasions by alien species','[{"text": "I, III and IV", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "I, II and III", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "II, III and IV", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "All are correct", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Niche specialization leads to greater species diversity.Points i, iii and iv support biodiversity .',NULL,'Hard','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(1355,'biology',103,969,2256,'Any agent that induces cancer is','[{"text": "Carcinogenic agent", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Genetic agent", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Oncogenic agent", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both \' 1 \' & \' 3 \'", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Transformation of normal cells into cancerous neoplastic cells may be induced by physical, chemical or biological agents. These agents are called carcinogenic agents or oncogenic agents.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(1203,'biology',105,1283,3102,'Select the correct answer<br>I. Many marine fish are infested with endoparasitic copepods.<br>II. The female mosquito is not considered a parasite, although it needs our blood for reproduction.','[{"text": "Only I is correct", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Only II is correct", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both are correct", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "None are correct", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'II. The female mosquito is not considered a parasite, although it needs our blood for reproduction.',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(1204,'biology',100,554,1109,'<strong>Assertion:</strong> Disintegration of the endometrium leads to the menstruation, marking a new cycle.<br><br><strong>Reason:</strong> After fertilisation, the corpus luteum degenerates','[{"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are correct and Reason is the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are correct but Reason is not the correct explanation of the Assertion.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Assertion is correct but Reason is incorrect.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both Assertion and Reason are incorrect", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'In the absence of fertilisation, the corpus luteum degenerates.',NULL,'Medium','Assertion and Reason',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(1205,'biology',103,967,2254,'MALT is the lymphoid tissue located within the lining of','[{"text": "Digestive system", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Respiratory system", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Urogenital system", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "All of them", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'MALT is a lymphoid tissue located within the lining of major tracts such as digestive tracts, urogenital tracts, and respiratory tracts.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL);
